WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.859
Another Thing Dr. Bright Is Not Allowed To
Do At The Foundation: Dr. Bright cannot declare

00:00:04.859 --> 00:00:09.790
himself “the Lord of Rodly Might” and
is hereby banned from playing Dungeons and

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:13.740
Dragons making use of SCPs to 'simulate the
real danger.'

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:18.500
Look, Dr. Bright, we know binging all of Stranger
Things has gotten you on a real D&amp;D kick,

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.760
but we need to draw the line somewhere.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:24.300
You’re also defeating the point of a game
based on imagination if you’re unleashing

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.070
real monsters on the players!

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:31.910
Also, we know you plan on telling SCP-2006
about the Demogorgon and we forbid it.

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:33.660
That goes for the Mindflayer, too!

